                            | Allergies recorded, Hydration Control, Climate Medical Advice, Log in & Settings, … etc.
                    .content-item
                        h4.content-item__title 
                            |Benefit #2: Easier Operations & Less Cost:
                        p.content-item__desc
                            | Features & Advantages: Payment, Doctors profiles, Branches locations & Facilities,
                            | Less human intervention, Feedback & Suggestions, Virtual Tour, Insurance approval,
                    .content-item
                        h4.content-item__title 
                            |Benefit #3: Increase Awareness & Profits:
                        p.content-item__desc
                            | Features & Advantage: Marketing Campaigns, ROI.
                .content-photo
                    img(src="/assets/images/servicesDetails.png")
